    {
      "modelVersion": "gemini-2.5-flash",
      "content": {
        "parts": [
          {
            "text": "Aquí tienes la consulta SQL para BigQuery que determina el recuento de pacientes según la cantidad de medicamentos diferentes que han recibido:\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n    distinct_drug_count,\n    COUNT(person_id) AS patient_count\nFROM\n    (\n        SELECT\n            person_id,\n            COUNT(DISTINCT drug_concept_id) AS distinct_drug_count\n        FROM\n            drug_exposure\n        GROUP BY\n            person_id\n    ) AS drug_counts_per_person\nGROUP BY\n    distinct_drug_count\nORDER BY\n    distinct_drug_count\n```"
          }
        ],
        "role": "model"
      },
